{
  "id": "gift-with-purchase-various-countries",
  "name": "Gift with purchase (various countries)",
  "category": "retailer_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "Cards given away with Pokémon TCG purchases at shops in more than one country, each with a logo on the picture. In 2016, the year of the Pokémon 20th anniversary, holo Generations cards with the 20th Anniversary logo went out in the United Kingdom and France, Pikachu among them at GAME shops from 25 March 2016, and EB Games shops in Australia gave Pikachu or Meowth in September 2016.\n\nLater ones carry their expansion's logo: Corviknight for Darkness Ablaze, from 14 August 2020 in eight European countries; Snorlax for Vivid Voltage, in Europe from 13 November 2020, the United Kingdom from 4 December and Chile from 22 December 2020; and Miraidon for Temporal Forces, from 22 March 2024 at Best Buy in the United States and shops in France, Belgium, the Netherlands, Germany, Italy and Spain. The oversize copies here, from Snorlax V to Miraidon ex and Koraidon ex, carry their expansion's logo too.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Bulbapedia: Generations (TCG), additional cards",
        "url": "https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Generations_(TCG)#Additional_cards"
      },
