        "url": "https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Snorlax_(Vivid_Voltage_131)#Release_information"
      },
      {
        "title": "Bulbapedia: Miraidon (Temporal Forces 121)",
        "url": "https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Miraidon_(Temporal_Forces_121)#Release_information"
